From: David Martin <dmarti47@emich.edu>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: omap2: leave IPL DRAM config alone on HogTied Boom! Box

The Boom! Box 6.5GT memory controller at 0x6D000000 is undocumented
silicon whose register layout matches AM35xx EMIF4, not the OMAP3 SDRC.
The stock QNX IPL configures DRAM before handing off, and HogTiedOS's rule
is to never reprogram it.

Mainline touches it in two places for any "ti,omap3" machine:
 - pdata_quirks_init() -> omap_sdrc_init() RMWs 0x6D000010 (EMIF4
   SDRAM_REF_CTRL here, changing refresh 0x50F -> 0x517) and writes
   0x6D000070.
 - omap3_init_late() -> omap3_pm_init() installs omap3_pm_idle(), which
   drives CORE/SDRAM low-power transitions designed around the SDRC.

Skip both when the root is compatible with "hogtied,boombox-6.5gt".

See docs/findings/CROSS_CHECKS.md in the HogTiedOS repo.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific safety workaround]
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-omap2/io.c b/arch/arm/mach-omap2/io.c
--- a/arch/arm/mach-omap2/io.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-omap2/io.c
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
 #include <linux/init.h>
 #include <linux/io.h>
 #include <linux/clk.h>
+#include <linux/of.h>
 
 #include <asm/tlb.h>
 #include <asm/mach/map.h>
@@ -498,6 +499,17 @@
 
 void __init omap3_init_late(void)
 {
+	/*
+	 * HogTied Boom! Box: omap3_pm_init() installs omap3_pm_idle(),
+	 * which drives CORE/SDRAM low-power transitions written for the
+	 * OMAP3 SDRC. The memory controller on this board is undocumented,
+	 * so skip OMAP3 PM entirely until it can be validated on hardware.
+	 */
+	if (of_machine_is_compatible("hogtied,boombox-6.5gt")) {
+		pr_info("HogTied: OMAP3 PM/idle disabled\n");
+		return;
+	}
+
 	omap_pm_soc_init = omap3_pm_init;
 }
 
diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-omap2/pdata-quirks.c b/arch/arm/mach-omap2/pdata-quirks.c
--- a/arch/arm/mach-omap2/pdata-quirks.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-omap2/pdata-quirks.c
@@ -560,8 +560,17 @@
 	 * We still need this for omap2420 and omap3 PM to work, others are
 	 * using drivers/misc/sram.c already.
 	 */
-	if (of_machine_is_compatible("ti,omap2420") ||
-	    of_machine_is_compatible("ti,omap3"))
+	/*
+	 * HogTied Boom! Box: the memory controller at 0x6D000000 is not an
+	 * OMAP3 SDRC (its register layout matches AM35xx EMIF4), and the
+	 * stock IPL has already configured it. omap2_sdrc_init() would RMW
+	 * 0x6D000010 (EMIF4 SDRAM_REF_CTRL on this part) and write
+	 * 0x6D000070, so leave the controller alone.
+	 */
+	if (of_machine_is_compatible("hogtied,boombox-6.5gt"))
+		pr_info("HogTied: skipping SDRC init, keeping IPL DRAM config\n");
+	else if (of_machine_is_compatible("ti,omap2420") ||
+		 of_machine_is_compatible("ti,omap3"))
 		omap_sdrc_init(NULL, NULL);
 
 	if (of_machine_is_compatible("ti,omap3"))
